WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:11.220
Trade pack: a ready pack for each trade: the flows, forms, messages, words and features that suit that business, installed in one go.

2
00:00:11.766 --> 00:00:16.280
In "Find your trade", pick the category or search for your trade.

3
00:00:16.829 --> 00:00:21.890
Install the pack; "Changes & details" shows exactly what was added.

4
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.910
Put your own prices and details in "Trade settings".

5
00:00:26.457 --> 00:00:32.560
Finish "Still to do"; for example, add your real photos with "Add the media".

6
00:00:33.113 --> 00:00:39.950
Replace the pack's sample prices and texts with your real details before switching the assistant on for customers.
